					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200690322,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}願意幫忙，我想想…雪山我聽說很大，也有很多不同的區域，保存的效果應該也不一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690323,
					"content": "唔，還是對比一下效果比較好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690324,
					"content": "#請{F#妳}{M#你}幫我把這些花分別放在雪山上的<color=#00E1FFFF>七天神像附近</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>雪山裡一個洞窟的入口</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690325,
					"content": "然後再<color=#00E1FFFF>在雪山裡找到一片水域</color>…不管是湖還是池塘都可以，然後把一盒花放在水邊吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690326,
					"content": "這次請您千萬小心一些，千萬別把它們弄壞了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690321,
					"content": "要埋在哪裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200690311,
					"content": "當天賣完就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200690312,
					"content": "這樣當然最好啦，但每天總歸會有那麼一兩枝沒人買的花。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690313,
					"content": "雖然只有這麼一兩枝，但我也不想讓它們就這樣白白枯萎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙蘿拉"
				}
			]
		},
